  "lessons": [
    "Legistar wildcard DNS: {anything}.legistar.com resolves; verify ONLY via webapi.legistar.com/v1/{slug}/bodies (200=live, 500=none, 403=token)",
    "Several state/city sites 403 plain HTTP clients (michigan.gov, louisvilleky.gov, tn.gov WAF) \u2014 Playwright pattern needed",
    "*.api.civicclerk.com and *.granicus.com can wildcard too \u2014 check for real JSON/content",
    "State 'open data' portals are heterogeneous: Socrata (MI, IL), custom AJAX (IN, KY), dead (WI data.wi.gov), SPA-only (OH)",
    "Socrata catalog API searches ALL domains unless filtered with domains={host}; MD serves under opendata.maryland.gov",
    "Verification pass 2026-08: 10/10 spot-checks passed. KY OpenDoor live API holds 377,039 spending records (we sampled 300) \u2014 bulk pull pending",
    "NC ArcGIS 'county boundaries' CSV is a national file hosted on NC hub \u2014 relabel before analysis use",
    "ArcGIS Hub: numberMatched only on /items endpoint; q=* returns 0; FeatureServer roots need layer-id resolution; item ids may need _0.._9 suffix",
    "Tyler Civic Access: public search gated behind Portico OIDC; full API route map extracted from SPA bundle (docs/TYLER_CIVIC_ACCESS.md); one manual account signup unlocks token capture"
  ],
